== Redmine Tags plugin changelog

Redmine Tags plugin - Tags board plugin for redmine
Copyright (C) 2011-2026 Kirill Bezrukov (RedmineUP)
http://www.redmineup.com/

== 2026-09-19 v0.0.7

Development. Plugin ID: :redmineup_tags
Target: Redmine 7.0.0 / Ruby 3.4 / Rails 8.1
Version in init.rb: 0.0.7 (Development)
Docs: doc/RELEASE_0.0.7.md

Scope: bug fixes and copy (no new features).

Permissions
* Issue tagging no longer registers :create_tags / :edit_tags (those names belong to Q&A)
* New names in Tags and tag clouds: create_issue_tags / edit_issue_tags
* Roles labels: Create issue tags / Edit issue tags (RU: Создание тегов задач / Редактирование тегов задач)
* Roles form checkboxes are independent of Q&A Create tags
* Create issue tags cannot be set without Edit issue tags (Roles UI + save + runtime check)
* On boot, roles that already had :create_tags / :edit_tags also receive the issue-tag permissions
* Issue form Select2 allows typing a new tag only with create_issue_tags
* Tests use :create_issue_tags / :edit_issue_tags
* Restored full ru.yml after a truncated label-only commit

Project settings Tag Clouds
* Edit Default Tags is enabled only for a full Redmine administrator; manage users see a disabled edit icon
* Project Reset is enabled only for a full Redmine administrator; manage users see a disabled Reset icon
* reset_preferences denies non-admin even with manage_tag_clouds

Locales
* Merged fragment files en_resets.yml, ru_resets.yml, en_system_hide.yml, ru_system_hide.yml into en.yml / ru.yml
* RU: Apply to all / Reset / Visible by default leftovers translated
* System hide hint follows the Hide Default Tags checkbox (Subprojects stays independent)

